The password for the next level is stored in the file data.txt and is the only line of text that occurs only once

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
I followed the following procedure:-
1. I listed the files in the home directory .
2. In the home directory there was only one file called 'datda.txt'.
3. So the problem stated that it is one with uniques value in the file.
4. So i used the 'sort' with 'uniq' parameter.
5. The command i used was
    sort data.txt| uniq -c
6. This gave me the password for bandit9.
